  "prototypeNotes": [
    "This index is the canonical discovery surface for all current Werewolf prototype test suites.",
    "The test model validates the supported Character creation slice and preserves blocked or future domains explicitly.",
    "Tests use deterministic Chronicle adapters and never call Narrative Intelligence providers.",
    "Fixture and suite artifacts are test-only inputs and never become runtime authority.",
